                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Orrin Hatch was a valued colleague and a dear friend.  When I was a new Senator, Orrin asked me to work with him on the Children\u2019s Health Insurance Program, which has since provided health care for millions of children in low-income families.  \n\nhttps://t.co/5ZZ42LFu8v",
