                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 129,
                "retweet_count": 17,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "I am pleased that the bill contains a special fund that I proposed to provide some assistance to our rural hospitals, but it is not sufficient to offset the other changes in the Medicaid system. \n\nWhile I continue to support the tax relief I voted for in 2017, I could not support these Medicaid changes and other issues.",
