                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 61,
                "retweet_count": 8,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "I was honored this week to receive the ANCOR Congressional Medicaid Champion Award for my efforts to protect Medicaid and Medicaid-funded services for those with intellectual and developmental disabilities.\n\nThroughout my Senate service, protecting Medicaid has been one of my highest priorities as Medicaid is essential in supporting rural hospitals, disabled and older Americans, and many families across the State of Maine.",
