                "retweet_count": 5,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "It was a great honor to be invited to speak at the World Medical Innovation Forum this week and hear firsthand from so many experts driving innovation and patient care. \n\nFrom strengthening our health agencies and supporting rural hospitals, to ensuring access to Medicaid and advancing medical breakthroughs, our work must focus on protecting patients, empowering researchers, and maintaining America\u2019s global leadership in health and science.",
